+UpdatePanelPicture(string txd, string txn)
+```
+
+```lua
+:UpdatePanelPicture(txd, txn)
+```
+
+### Add / Remove Item
+
+```c#
+AddItem(UIFreemodeDetailsItem item)
+RemoveItem(int idx)
+```
+
+```lua
+:AddItem(newitem)
+:RemoveItemAt(index)
+```
